# OmniWM v0.7.4 skhd layer — commands its native hotkey schema cannot bind.
# Only active via wm-switch's active-wm.skhd; skhd consumes chords even when a
# CLI command fails, so never include this beside another WM's bindings.
# Absolute CLI path: skhd's launchd PATH does not include Homebrew or Nix.
# Comma/period as ANSI key codes (0x2B/0x2F): skhd.zig has no `comma`/`period`
# literal and exits on the parse error, taking every layer down with it.
alt - 0x2B : /Applications/OmniWM.app/Contents/MacOS/omniwmctl command consume-window-into-column
alt - 0x2F : /Applications/OmniWM.app/Contents/MacOS/omniwmctl command expel-window-from-column
alt - a : /Applications/OmniWM.app/Contents/MacOS/omniwmctl command focus left
alt - d : /Applications/OmniWM.app/Contents/MacOS/omniwmctl command focus right
shift + alt - a : /Applications/OmniWM.app/Contents/MacOS/omniwmctl command move left
shift + alt - d : /Applications/OmniWM.app/Contents/MacOS/omniwmctl command move right
alt - r : sh ~/.config/skhd/omniwm-ratio.sh 66.667% 33.333%
shift + alt - r : sh ~/.config/skhd/omniwm-ratio.sh 33.333% 66.667%
